<title>INDIA: India's Shriram Honda 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Shriram Honda 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 184.8  vs    141.8</p>
<p>    Net sales		 1,499   vs  1,364</p>
<p>    Div (in percent)	  40.0  vs    N/A</p>
<p>    Other income		35.5  vs    12.7</p>
<p>    Total expenditure    1,230.7  vs 1,150.6</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    16.0  vs    22.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation		36.1  vs    32.4</p>
<p>    Provision for tax	 67.1  vs    29.5</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in statement that operations in 1996/97 were affected for a short duration by adverse industrial relations at its Rudrapur plant. The statement said the issue had been amicably resolved.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
